/* 关系探索手记（Figma 667:6316）：状态与起点画像、讨论问题、任务材料、青瓷浅底的下一步任务、边界说明。 */
.narrative-page {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: var(--p3-section);
  padding-top: 16rpx;
  padding-bottom: calc(72rpx + env(safe-area-inset-bottom));
}

.narrative-start,
.narrative-section {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: flex-start;
  gap: var(--p3-stack);
}

.narrative-section {
  align-items: stretch;
}

.narrative-box {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-self: stretch;
  gap: var(--p3-tight);
  padding: 28rpx 32rpx;
  border-radius: var(--p3-radius-group);
  background: var(--p3-surface);
}

.narrative-box--tight {
  gap: 8rpx;
}

.narrative-copy {
  color: var(--p3-ink);
  font-size: 30rpx;
  line-height: 52rpx;
  overflow-wrap: anywhere;
}

.narrative-next {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: var(--p3-tight);
  padding: 36rpx;
  border-radius: var(--p3-radius-card);
  background: var(--p3-soft);
}
